{"url": "https://wiki.idlecorp.xyz/api.php?format=json&formatversion=2&action=parse&page=Energy&prop=text%7Clinks%7Cimages%7Ctemplates%7Ccategories&redirects=1", "retrievedAt": "2026-10-09T14:55:19.267457+00:00", "body": "{\"parse\":{\"title\":\"Energy\",\"pageid\":78,\"redirects\":[],\"text\":\"<div class=\\\"mw-parser-output\\\"><p>Energy can be produced using <a href=\\\"/index.php/Coal_power_plant\\\" title=\\\"Coal power plant\\\">Coal power plants</a> or <a href=\\\"/index.php/Solar_power_plant\\\" title=\\\"Solar power plant\\\">Solar power plants</a>. In physics, energy is the quantitative property that must be transferred to an object in order to perform work on any object. It can neither be created nor destroyed. Energy is also proportional to mass and is explained by the famous formula e=mc^2.\\n</p>\\n<h2><span class=\\\"mw-headline\\\" id=\\\"Energy_Production\\\">Energy Production</span><span class=\\\"mw-editsection\\\"><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">[</span><a href=\\\"/index.php?title=Energy&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\\\" title=\\\"Edit section: Energy Production\\\">edit</a><span class=\\\"mw-editsection-bracket\\\">]</span></span></h2>\\n<table class=\\\"wikitable sortable\\\">\\n<tbody><tr>\\n<th>Name</th>\\n<th>Cost</th>\\n<th>Inputs</th>\\n<th>Outputs</th>\\n<th>Profit/Min</th>\\n<th>Production <br />interval (MM:SS)\\n</th></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><a href=\\\"/index.php/Coal_power_plant\\\" title=\\\"Coal power plant\\\">Coal power plant</a></td>\\n<td>$500,000</td>\\n<td>50x <a href=\\\"/index.php/Coal\\\" title=\\\"Coal\\\">coal</a></td>\\n<td>35x <a class=\\\"mw-selflink selflink\\\">energy</a></td>\\n<td>$680.00</td>\\n<td>0:30\\n</td></tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td><a href=\\\"/index.php/Solar_power_plant\\\" title=\\\"Solar power plant\\\">Solar power plant</a></td>\\n<td>$1,000,000</td>\\n<td>N/A</td>\\n<td>60x <a class=\\\"mw-selflink selflink\\\">energy</a></td>\\n<td>$400.00</td>\\n<td>1:30\\n</td></tr>\\n</tbody></table>\\n<h2><span cla